# Havey flow design

When creating or editing flow prototypes, onboarding integration, or related design docs:

1. **Read first:** [`apps/design/FLOW-DESIGN-GUARDRAILS.md`](../../apps/design/FLOW-DESIGN-GUARDRAILS.md)
2. **Work only under** `apps/design/flows/` for HTML screen specs.
3. **Keep illustration PNGs** in `apps/design/onboarding/` — no HTML there.
4. **Mobile first; web follows.** Use `tokens/css/havey-tokens.css` — no hardcoded brand hex.
5. **One HTML file = one screen state.** Use shared phone frame from `flows/shared/`.
6. **Link to `HAV-*`** in each flow folder README.

Do not copy prototype HTML into Flutter or Next.js production code.
